  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】道後温泉本館周辺の露天風呂付き客室おすすめ宿！花ゆづき・道後舘・茶玻瑠・八千代徹底比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-rose-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">♨️ 道後温泉「本館周辺ステイ」を満喫する3つのポイント</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-2 text-xs text-stone-800\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-amber-900\">🚶 浴衣で湯巡り徒歩1〜3分：</strong> 本館や飛鳥乃湯泉へ浴衣・下駄でふらりと出かけられる立地が最高に快適。</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-amber-900\">🛀 客室露天風呂のプライベート感：</strong> 観光客で賑わう温泉街の喧騒を離れ、自室で好きな時に名湯を満喫。</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-amber-900\">🐟 宇和島鯛めし＆伊予牛：</strong> 瀬戸内の新鮮な真鯛を特製タレと卵でいただく鯛めしと伊予牛の極上会席。</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 道後温泉で後悔しない厳選5選</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">道後温泉　花ゆづき</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.02</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/16719/16719.jpg\" alt=\"道後温泉　花ゆづき 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 round